<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hologic downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hologic downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal &amp; Co said on Thursday it lowered its rating on Hologic Inc to a hold from a buy, because of the stock's valuation.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Christina Rizopoulos Valauri said in a research note the stock was trading about 10 percent below the low end of her 12-month price target of $30 to $32 per share. She said she had not changed her earnings estimates.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We continue to believe the long-term fundamental outlook remains strong for Hologic as a global market leader of bone assessment technology,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>-- Hologic stock was off 2-1/4 at 25.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
